{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cIs this a Game yet?\u201d is an open invitation: you and me, building a game live, one update at a time. In the beginning you\u2019ll find exactly one button and a global leaderboard. No tutorials, no roadmaps. Every click, every idea, every vote shapes what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HOW IT WORKS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blank Canvas Start</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One button, one counter, zero instructions. Your clicks fill an empty leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player-Driven Updates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each cycle, the top 3 global scorers and top 2 most liked submissions will be chosen and implemented in the very next update cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live Co-Development</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All development happens live on stream. Jump into chat, suggest features on the fly, watch your ideas take shape in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless Possibilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Today it\u2019s a clicker, tomorrow a platformer, puzzle, RPG, or something entirely new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHY JUMP IN NOW?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No paid Expansions. Purchase early and enjoy all future updates forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not just playing, you\u2019re designing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real-time feedback via development live streams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rapid update cycles mean the game never feels the same twice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join a tight-knit community where every vote matters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EARLY ACCESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click, climb, design! Let's find out together if we can turn the answer to &quot;Is this a Game yet?&quot; from a <strong>No</strong> into a resounding\u00a0<strong>Yes</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831220?t=1753884448","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/4f6f25b18ab136f00a64afe33650a05c78b62f8f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753884448","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/c0cd4b843658fe06e982a01b7abb4bcccf03c8b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753884448","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/c0cd4b843658fe06e982a01b7abb4bcccf03c8b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753884448","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cIs this a Game yet?\u201d is an open invitation: you and me, building a game live, one update at a time. In the beginning you\u2019ll find exactly one button and a global leaderboard. No tutorials, no roadmaps. Every click, every idea, every vote shapes what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HOW IT WORKS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blank Canvas Start</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One button, one counter, zero instructions. Your clicks fill an empty leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player-Driven Updates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each cycle, the top 3 global scorers and top 2 most liked submissions will be chosen and implemented in the very next update cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p 